{"2982360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bandit Trap", "steam_appid": 2982360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get ready for the ultimate boobytrap friends showdown — always playable solo, or online with your friends.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAUSE CHAOS:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetric 3v1 multiplayer</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics‑based gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destructible, reactive environments</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build devastating trap combinations</strong> to outsmart invading Bandits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic loadouts</strong> with perks, scanners, and tools</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY YOUR WAY:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for parties</strong>, co‑op sessions, and online game nights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play solo</strong> with smart AI bots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, replayable matches</strong> full of unpredictable moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free seasons</strong> with<strong> </strong>new cosmetics to unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/1983fc05710f19036353869c397a7869.avif?t=1779802407\" width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/c5ca1d720f7ce5f9a702a496d37cee41.poster.avif?t=1779802407\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/c5ca1d720f7ce5f9a702a496d37cee41.webm?t=1779802407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/c5ca1d720f7ce5f9a702a496d37cee41.mp4?t=1779802407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategise with your crew, choose the right gear, perks and map out tactics before the match starts. Choose wisely and outsmart the Trapper with the right setup!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/70b1342243c24d8bba0db3cc7a6581bc.poster.avif?t=1779802407\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/70b1342243c24d8bba0db3cc7a6581bc.webm?t=1779802407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/70b1342243c24d8bba0db3cc7a6581bc.mp4?t=1779802407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade traps, fight the Trapper and master a huge variety of scanners and tools to loot hidden treasures. Survive the Trapper attacks and find all 10 hidden treasures to claim victory!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/699713bfd0b904c921194214a695b3d0.avif?t=1779802407\" width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"